WEBVTT

01:40.590 --> 01:45.729
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.160 --> 01:50.650
[Episode 29]

02:05.590 --> 02:06.280
Father.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.520
You've finally found me.

02:11.080 --> 02:11.710
Father.

02:12.410 --> 02:13.880
Are you really beyond the Boundary?

02:13.880 --> 02:15.080
Tell me where you are.

02:15.090 --> 02:16.150
I'll come save you.

02:16.300 --> 02:17.680
All this time,

02:18.720 --> 02:20.579
I've been communicating with you

02:21.240 --> 02:23.570
through dreams, using my consciousness.

02:23.910 --> 02:24.520
Father.

02:24.540 --> 02:25.990
Let me tell you

02:26.430 --> 02:28.680
why I came here first.

02:32.110 --> 02:33.510
When you turned sixteen,

02:33.960 --> 02:35.030
your uncle Yang He,

02:35.400 --> 02:36.750
Yitan's father,

02:37.020 --> 02:38.950
saw something terrifying.

02:40.079 --> 02:41.040
He said

02:41.310 --> 02:43.150
through some unknown means,

02:43.800 --> 02:45.510
the Black Grief Tree beyond the Boundary

02:45.510 --> 02:47.840
had connected with the Tushan Grief Tree.

02:48.870 --> 02:50.750
Through the Tushan Grief Tree,

02:50.870 --> 02:55.000
the Black Fox was frantically absorbing hatred from within the Boundary.

02:55.520 --> 02:57.590
Yang He used all his spiritual energy

02:57.610 --> 02:59.079
to forcefully activate his Clairvoyance

02:59.079 --> 03:01.650
and saw the weak point in this connection

03:01.960 --> 03:03.230
beyond the Boundary.

03:03.750 --> 03:06.480
So I came here with the Wangquan Sword.

04:06.800 --> 04:08.800
Who's that? Speak!

04:10.910 --> 04:14.030
After severing the connection between the two Grief Trees,

04:14.030 --> 04:16.360
the Black Fox discovered my whereabouts.

04:16.720 --> 04:20.110
I realized I was no match for her.

04:20.390 --> 04:22.360
I could only hide in the shadows,

04:22.430 --> 04:24.240
concealing myself

04:24.580 --> 04:28.380
and communicating with you through dreams using my consciousness.

04:28.920 --> 04:31.250
But my willpower is limited,

04:31.630 --> 04:32.720
so I can only

04:32.720 --> 04:34.720
speak to you briefly each time.

04:38.890 --> 04:40.130
Yang He said

04:41.270 --> 04:42.730
during the solar eclipse,

04:43.790 --> 04:45.970
the Black Grief Tree's hatred peaks,

04:46.720 --> 04:47.900
so it's most likely

04:48.390 --> 04:51.250
to connect with the Grief Tree within the Boundary.

04:52.280 --> 04:53.960
There's one coming soon.

04:55.220 --> 04:56.420
You must be vigilant.

04:57.310 --> 04:59.000
You cannot let her succeed.

04:59.810 --> 05:00.610
I understand.

05:00.830 --> 05:02.800
The Black Fox is terrifying powerful.

05:02.800 --> 05:04.130
She can control others.

05:04.270 --> 05:06.070
Without thorough preparation,

05:06.730 --> 05:08.600
never rashly venture beyond the Boundary.

05:08.600 --> 05:09.190
But Father...

05:09.190 --> 05:10.270
No buts!

05:11.390 --> 05:13.150
Don't let my efforts be in vain.

05:13.180 --> 05:15.510
Don't let everyone's efforts go to waste!

05:15.840 --> 05:18.050
Unless you're sure you can kill her,

05:18.390 --> 05:20.240
you mustn't rush to your death!

05:23.420 --> 05:24.470
Yes, Father.

05:28.770 --> 05:29.770
Hongye,

05:30.750 --> 05:31.460
kneel down.

05:36.020 --> 05:36.960
Kneel down.

05:39.530 --> 05:43.520
♪ A sudden storm fills the night ♪

05:44.150 --> 05:48.140
♪ 3,000 mayflies plunge into the dark river ♪

05:48.540 --> 05:49.909
♪ The relentless march of time ♪

05:50.530 --> 05:52.720
♪ Sweeping away the young you and me ♪

05:53.170 --> 05:54.700
♪ I open my eyes ♪

05:55.409 --> 05:57.640
♪ To the color of the night ♪

05:58.610 --> 06:02.640
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

06:03.090 --> 06:07.210
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

06:07.820 --> 06:10.010
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

06:10.910 --> 06:12.470
♪ Side by side ♪

06:10.970 --> 06:12.820
The coming-of-age ceremony is complete.

06:12.820 --> 06:16.970
♪ I remember every moment as clear as daylight ♪

06:12.890 --> 06:14.150
From this day forward,

06:14.960 --> 06:16.690
restrain your willful nature,

06:17.350 --> 06:18.780
uphold the virtues of our ancestors,

06:17.970 --> 06:19.850
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

06:19.720 --> 06:20.950
and strive for self-cultivation and world peace.

06:20.180 --> 06:21.130
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

06:21.520 --> 06:22.620
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

06:22.780 --> 06:23.500
♪ Your warmth ♪

06:23.750 --> 06:26.780
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

06:24.560 --> 06:25.960
Although I'm not bright,

06:27.440 --> 06:29.510
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

06:28.120 --> 06:30.080
I respectfully accept your blessing.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.950
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

06:32.500 --> 06:33.770
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

06:34.440 --> 06:36.420
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

06:36.909 --> 06:38.990
♪ With the wind ♪

06:38.620 --> 06:39.870
My son, Hongye,

06:39.530 --> 06:41.270
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

06:40.650 --> 06:42.210
you have come of age.

06:41.620 --> 06:43.659
♪ Whose lashes ♪

06:42.870 --> 06:44.310
Remember my words.

06:44.350 --> 06:46.080
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

06:45.830 --> 06:48.750
Once you grasp the essence of the Unparalleled Sword,

06:46.860 --> 06:48.570
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

06:49.420 --> 06:50.930
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

06:50.090 --> 06:51.490
the Wangquan Sword

06:51.250 --> 06:52.070
♪ You still come to me ♪

06:51.750 --> 06:53.420
will come to you!

06:52.480 --> 06:55.420
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

07:10.500 --> 07:12.510
I finally know where my father is,

07:13.530 --> 07:16.030
and that the final battle with the Black Fox is imminent.

07:15.330 --> 07:19.400
♪ With a wave of the sword, the mountains and rivers are ravaged ♪

07:17.280 --> 07:18.280
This battle

07:19.250 --> 07:20.490
is not just for my father

07:19.770 --> 07:23.870
♪ In an instant, I shelter myself in this fleeting life ♪

07:21.720 --> 07:24.480
but also to change the fates of all humans and demons.

07:24.400 --> 07:26.760
♪ Countless times we traversed cliffs and abysses ♪

07:26.160 --> 07:28.400
My comrades in the Mask Group

07:27.840 --> 07:29.220
♪ Side by side ♪

07:29.190 --> 07:31.560
are also working to unveil the mask

07:29.730 --> 07:33.260
♪ I remember every moment as clear as daylight ♪

07:32.150 --> 07:33.420
of this world.

07:34.590 --> 07:36.510
♪ This heavy snowfall brought by fate ♪

07:36.860 --> 07:37.900
♪ This hopeless struggle ♪

07:38.409 --> 07:39.190
♪ Is it insoluble? ♪

07:39.570 --> 07:40.220
♪ Your warmth ♪

07:40.430 --> 07:43.510
♪ A trace alone breaks down my heart's defenses ♪

07:44.330 --> 07:46.220
♪ Across countless withered bones and fallen leaves ♪

07:46.830 --> 07:48.740
♪ Watching a blood-red sunset together ♪

07:49.610 --> 07:50.630
♪ I thank the heavens ♪

07:51.350 --> 07:53.120
♪ I get to brave the blizzard with you in this life ♪

07:54.090 --> 07:55.630
♪ With the wind ♪

07:56.550 --> 07:58.020
♪ Comes countless farewells ♪

07:58.750 --> 08:00.360
♪ Whose lashes ♪

08:01.290 --> 08:02.770
♪ Are dyed red? ♪

08:03.530 --> 08:05.300
♪ Even if a single sword ♪

08:06.140 --> 08:07.550
♪ Turns love and hate to ashes ♪

08:07.970 --> 08:08.880
♪ You still come to me ♪

08:09.390 --> 08:11.940
♪ Fulfilling our destiny ♪

08:13.060 --> 08:14.760
♪ The rain falls ♪

08:15.670 --> 08:17.250
♪ Tearing apart the long night ♪

08:17.980 --> 08:19.660
♪ Unraveling ♪

08:20.530 --> 08:22.050
♪ My suppressed tribulation ♪

08:22.650 --> 08:24.550
♪ Flowers on the distant end bloom ♪

08:25.500 --> 08:26.770
♪ So near yet so far ♪

08:27.410 --> 08:31.070
♪ Get dead-drunk again, with no care of the passing of time ♪

08:41.200 --> 08:42.070
Your Highness.

08:42.090 --> 08:43.650
The solar eclipse is approaching.

08:43.650 --> 08:45.890
The Grief Trees will be reconnected.

08:46.760 --> 08:48.780
Your Highness is mighty.

08:49.400 --> 08:52.030
Connecting the Grief Trees is crucial.

08:52.960 --> 08:55.430
Do you think Lord Jiuhuo alone

08:55.660 --> 08:56.870
can handle it?

09:06.850 --> 09:14.470
[Unparalleled Sword]

09:07.030 --> 09:08.270
So Uncle Shouzhuo

09:08.600 --> 09:11.660
went beyond the Boundary alone to sever the connection

09:12.520 --> 09:14.160
between the Grief Trees?

09:14.820 --> 09:17.320
At my father's request, your father

09:17.840 --> 09:20.110
exhausted his spiritual energy to activate his Clairvoyance

09:20.110 --> 09:22.370
and saw the weak point in the connection.

09:24.080 --> 09:26.070
That's why when Uncle Yang

09:26.390 --> 09:27.520
fell gravely ill...

09:32.550 --> 09:33.270
Yitan.

09:34.390 --> 09:35.150
I'm sorry.

09:40.120 --> 09:41.210
What for?

09:43.240 --> 09:44.320
In this life,

09:45.430 --> 09:46.960
I've found a true confidant

09:47.440 --> 09:49.100
to celebrate my happy moments

09:49.670 --> 09:51.330
and brave hardship together.

09:52.360 --> 09:53.510
I'm beyond lucky.

09:56.670 --> 09:57.930
When my father passed,

09:58.960 --> 10:00.150
I was by his side.

10:01.510 --> 10:02.640
He left with a smile,

10:03.670 --> 10:05.840
so I guess he had no regrets.

10:10.270 --> 10:11.130
Right, Hongye,

10:11.240 --> 10:12.240
you just said that

10:12.240 --> 10:13.570
around a solar eclipse,

10:13.600 --> 10:15.960
the two Grief Trees are most likely to connect.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.080
Based on celestial signs,

10:17.080 --> 10:19.000
there will be a solar eclipse soon.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.390
I'll keep watch near Tushan.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.150
Okay.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.440
Get Zui to go with you.

10:22.910 --> 10:23.600
Okay.

10:23.810 --> 10:33.540
[Unparalleled Sword]

10:34.870 --> 10:36.840
We need fresh flowers for the memorial.

10:36.840 --> 10:37.510
And...

10:39.390 --> 10:40.850
I'm sure your mother loved

10:41.150 --> 10:42.280
looking beautiful.

10:44.320 --> 10:45.650
You didn't have to come.

10:46.010 --> 10:48.340
You could've just waited for me at Tushan.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.870
Do you know what this means?

10:57.030 --> 10:57.670
I do.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.200
We're family now.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.850
I shouldn't be too polite.

11:02.200 --> 11:03.330
That's more like it.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.990
You're here, Miss Wangquan.

11:08.030 --> 11:08.960
Hello, Grandpa.

11:09.510 --> 11:11.420
We've just made some date cakes.

11:11.550 --> 11:12.600
Want to try some?

11:12.870 --> 11:14.510
Sure, I'll go try it.

11:14.610 --> 11:17.700
I'll leave you two to have a good chat.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.820
Why do you suddenly want to

11:40.550 --> 11:41.870
go see your parents?

11:50.030 --> 11:51.000
Yitan.

11:53.240 --> 11:56.120
I've made many mistakes in the past.

11:59.000 --> 12:02.870
Anyway, the Yang family is in your hands now.

12:04.910 --> 12:06.320
I have no more regrets.

12:09.150 --> 12:09.910
Grandpa.

12:11.910 --> 12:13.970
I know the cause of my father's death.

12:21.820 --> 12:23.140
That's what happened.

12:24.910 --> 12:25.600
Grandpa.

12:27.270 --> 12:29.000
My father and Uncle Shouzhuo

12:29.790 --> 12:32.190
protected both the human and demon worlds.

12:32.680 --> 12:33.940
If it weren't for them,

12:35.440 --> 12:38.000
the Eternal Night might've already descended.

12:38.000 --> 12:40.270
Wangquan Shouzhuo discovered

12:41.270 --> 12:44.330
the rapid increase of resentment beyond the Boundary.

12:44.600 --> 12:47.870
So he asked He to activate his Clairvoyance.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.150
Yes.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.360
On what grounds?

12:51.760 --> 12:54.840
Wangquan Shouzhuo is the leader of Yiqi Alliance.

12:55.270 --> 12:57.070
In his pursuit of fame and glory,

12:57.510 --> 12:59.600
what right does he have to take away my He?

12:59.600 --> 13:00.270
Grandpa.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.030
What?

13:01.960 --> 13:03.510
Am I wrong?

13:03.600 --> 13:04.660
In this world,

13:05.440 --> 13:07.720
who'd risk their life just for fame and glory?

13:07.720 --> 13:09.510
Because within the Yiqi Alliance,

13:09.510 --> 13:12.370
his Wangquan family has immense wealth and status.

13:15.720 --> 13:18.120
Of course he can risk his life to protect it.

13:18.750 --> 13:20.680
But what does our Yang family have?

13:20.910 --> 13:22.150
We have nothing!

13:22.390 --> 13:23.390
Life isn't just

13:24.790 --> 13:26.200
about fame and fortune.

13:27.950 --> 13:29.000
Without money

13:29.000 --> 13:29.910
and power,

13:30.630 --> 13:33.040
humans are worse off than livestock.

13:33.240 --> 13:36.600
You'll see all the ugliness in this world.

13:38.720 --> 13:40.230
Is Wangquan Hongye still

13:40.600 --> 13:43.200
planning to investigate the Black Fox matter?

13:43.670 --> 13:45.630
Don't risk your life with him.

13:46.200 --> 13:48.960
You're the last hope of our Yang family.

14:00.370 --> 14:01.390
I can't ignore it.

14:03.370 --> 14:03.960
Grandpa,

14:05.360 --> 14:06.550
you should rest early.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.270
Yitan!

14:09.030 --> 14:10.550
I've sworn on behalf of our family

14:10.550 --> 14:13.200
to stand with the Wangquans through thick and thin.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.030
I'm in charge

14:14.960 --> 14:15.960
of our family now.

14:16.870 --> 14:17.550
Grandpa,

14:19.150 --> 14:20.810
just enjoy your golden years.

14:46.040 --> 14:50.130
[Tomb of beloved son Yang He and virtuous daughter-in-law Ye Yuwei]

14:52.800 --> 14:55.630
I heard you arguing with Grandpa.

15:00.110 --> 15:01.310
I thought

15:02.090 --> 15:03.620
he'd understand my father.

15:04.870 --> 15:06.030
Now I realize

15:07.390 --> 15:09.600
my father knew my grandpa too well.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.660
That's why he kept it a secret.

15:17.830 --> 15:18.960
The Yang family...

15:20.800 --> 15:22.350
is really a mess.

15:26.960 --> 15:28.150
Uncle Yang He,

15:28.490 --> 15:29.480
Aunt Yang Yan,

15:30.000 --> 15:30.720
and you

15:31.380 --> 15:33.110
are all brilliant like pearls.

15:33.520 --> 15:34.430
How's that

15:35.150 --> 15:36.120
a mess?

15:38.360 --> 15:39.150
I'm fine.

15:40.150 --> 15:41.750
You don't have to cheer me up.

15:49.670 --> 15:50.600
Father-in-law,

15:50.630 --> 15:51.560
Mother-in-law,

15:51.740 --> 15:53.140
let me introduce myself.

15:53.790 --> 15:54.440
I am

15:54.910 --> 15:56.030
Wangquan Zui.

15:56.930 --> 15:58.380
From now on, Yitan will be

15:59.120 --> 16:00.120
under my care.

16:00.530 --> 16:01.510
Rest assured.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.380
I have a fierce temper.

16:03.390 --> 16:06.670
I'll deal with anyone or anything

16:07.120 --> 16:08.390
that upsets Yitan.

16:35.790 --> 16:36.550
Master,

16:36.680 --> 16:37.630
here you are.

16:37.880 --> 16:40.240
These are the jewelry sent from Ruyi Pavilion.

16:40.240 --> 16:41.600
Please choose a few pieces

16:41.600 --> 16:43.200
for use at the grand wedding.

16:49.210 --> 16:51.290
Don't call me Master anymore.

16:53.390 --> 16:55.120
Put the things down and leave.

17:28.800 --> 17:30.390
Long time no see.

17:31.200 --> 17:33.730
You think your family will rise to prominence

17:34.070 --> 17:37.000
by Yang Yitan marrying Wangquan Zui.

17:37.440 --> 17:40.290
You sure are foolish, Yang Huanzhou.

17:42.790 --> 17:45.000
Yang He died because of the Wangquans.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.960
Yang Ying is gone for good.

17:47.610 --> 17:51.400
Yang Yitan will also soon embark on this path of no return.

17:53.680 --> 17:55.390
Our Clairvoyant Yangs

17:56.680 --> 17:59.280
are just sacrificial pawns for the Wangquans!

18:00.750 --> 18:02.400
Now you get it.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.700
By marrying Wangquan Zui,

18:05.350 --> 18:06.510
the Yangs will

18:07.160 --> 18:09.830
completely become a vassal of the Wangquans,

18:10.680 --> 18:14.270
until they've squeezed you dry.

18:27.830 --> 18:30.020
[Tushan]

18:33.790 --> 18:34.590
Take a look.

18:35.090 --> 18:35.790
Look.

18:36.750 --> 18:38.400
They say the Grief Tree is magical.

18:38.400 --> 18:38.880
Yeah.

18:38.900 --> 18:40.100
Yitan, look!

18:40.270 --> 18:41.200
The Grief Tree!

18:45.110 --> 18:46.170
So beautiful.

18:48.500 --> 18:52.140
If only the Grief Tree could also grant humans

18:52.470 --> 18:54.040
with renewed love

18:54.350 --> 18:55.550
in their next life...

18:59.150 --> 19:00.610
Humans only have one life.

19:01.440 --> 19:03.500
It's enough to live without regrets.

19:03.800 --> 19:05.270
So unromantic.

19:07.570 --> 19:08.570
You're right too.

19:25.350 --> 19:26.790
Are you two interested

19:26.790 --> 19:28.720
in our Tushan red love knot?

19:28.830 --> 19:29.790
I have it already.

19:29.790 --> 19:30.590
Want one?

19:30.720 --> 19:31.110
No.

19:32.410 --> 19:34.170
We bought from him before.

19:35.350 --> 19:36.250
Sir, Miss,

19:36.830 --> 19:37.720
would you like

19:37.720 --> 19:39.680
a pair of our Tushan red love knot?

19:39.720 --> 19:41.120
They're very effective.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.160
What knot?

19:43.440 --> 19:45.560
The Tushan red love knot.

19:45.750 --> 19:48.270
They've been blessed by our Tushan leader

19:48.310 --> 19:49.400
personally.

19:49.510 --> 19:50.770
It's super effective.

19:51.510 --> 19:54.030
I didn't know the Tushan leader was in this business too.

19:54.030 --> 19:54.960
Of course!

19:55.070 --> 19:55.920
Listen...

19:58.240 --> 20:00.040
Come, come closer.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.680
Do you see these red threads?

20:01.680 --> 20:02.710
It's super red

20:03.030 --> 20:04.030
because it's dyed

20:04.070 --> 20:05.860
with the juice of the flowers

20:06.030 --> 20:07.070
from the Grief Tree!

20:07.070 --> 20:08.310
I don't tell this to just anyone.

20:08.310 --> 20:09.030
Take a look.

20:15.240 --> 20:16.110
Have a look.

20:16.270 --> 20:17.200
The love knot.

20:18.240 --> 20:20.480
Tushan forbids humans from entering.

20:20.830 --> 20:22.230
How'd you get the flowers

20:22.400 --> 20:23.240
from the Grief Tree?

20:23.240 --> 20:24.280
Um...

20:24.880 --> 20:26.070
The wind blew them here.

20:26.070 --> 20:26.920
Yitan.

20:27.030 --> 20:28.310
What's with the interrogation?

20:28.310 --> 20:29.970
They're just doing business.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.240
Yes, yes.

20:36.720 --> 20:37.350
Pay him.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.590
This is called...

20:41.680 --> 20:43.640
The Tushan red love knot.

20:43.790 --> 20:44.590
The love knot.

20:44.590 --> 20:45.510
Right, right.

20:45.510 --> 20:46.500
We'll buy it.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.200
Thank you, Miss. Thank you.

20:48.200 --> 20:49.720
Pay him. Quickly.

20:50.110 --> 20:51.280
Thank you, Miss.

20:54.790 --> 20:55.750
Thank you, Sir.

20:55.880 --> 20:56.740
Enjoy, you two.

21:00.270 --> 21:01.000
Wait,

21:01.510 --> 21:02.590
you believe in

21:02.790 --> 21:03.650
such nonsense?

21:04.310 --> 21:06.350
They're selling a sentiment.

21:08.510 --> 21:09.240
A story.

21:09.740 --> 21:11.500
We're selling a story.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.880
When you get home,

21:14.240 --> 21:16.170
you must not cut these red threads.

21:16.510 --> 21:18.270
If you two can hold hands

21:18.680 --> 21:20.160
and spend the night with it,

21:20.160 --> 21:21.960
I guarantee your love will last

21:21.960 --> 21:22.680
forever.

21:22.750 --> 21:23.310
Got it?

21:23.440 --> 21:25.090
Your love will last forever.

21:25.240 --> 21:26.640
Forever and ever!

21:26.640 --> 21:27.160
Got it?

21:29.000 --> 21:30.140
This sells the best.

21:45.790 --> 21:48.160
You believe in such scams?

21:48.270 --> 21:50.790
It's better to be safe than sorry

21:51.000 --> 21:52.200
in matters like this.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.680
Yitan,

22:04.160 --> 22:05.690
don't go anywhere tonight.

22:06.160 --> 22:07.170
Stay here with me.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.400
Sure.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.980
♪ Has there been a dream ♪

22:31.690 --> 22:35.260
♪ Where you cried and chased after someone's back? ♪

22:36.230 --> 22:40.260
♪ Your face is streaked with tears when you wake up ♪

22:42.130 --> 22:43.040
♪ Memories are like wind ♪

22:43.280 --> 22:45.010
In this life, my heart

22:43.500 --> 22:45.230
♪ Traveling a long journey ♪

22:45.230 --> 22:45.840
is full

22:45.730 --> 22:47.680
♪ The sun sets and the moon rises ♪

22:46.830 --> 22:47.580
with you.

22:48.330 --> 22:50.080
♪ You're a wavering candle flame ♪

22:50.670 --> 22:53.560
♪ Shedding light on our past ♪

22:54.540 --> 22:56.080
♪ How do I ♪

22:56.490 --> 22:57.930
♪ Tell you ♪

22:58.410 --> 22:59.970
♪ I love you? ♪

23:00.700 --> 23:02.420
♪ How do I ♪

23:02.690 --> 23:04.130
♪ Tell you how much ♪

23:04.750 --> 23:06.790
♪ I miss you? ♪

23:07.670 --> 23:10.400
♪ A parting is like a tree's growth ring ♪

23:11.100 --> 23:13.470
♪ The rings are trapping ♪

23:14.170 --> 23:18.970
♪ All the lovesick souls ♪

23:20.350 --> 23:22.710
♪ No words are needed when our eyes lock ♪

23:23.540 --> 23:25.720
♪ No words are needed when our souls connect ♪

23:26.450 --> 23:28.670
♪ Turn around, love is like falling petals ♪

23:29.620 --> 23:31.940
♪ How to grow roots? ♪

23:32.890 --> 23:35.590
♪ No words are needed when we brush shoulders ♪

23:36.240 --> 23:38.820
♪ It goes without saying that we yearn for each other ♪

23:39.610 --> 23:42.260
♪ We missed out on each other ♪

23:43.020 --> 23:46.190
♪ We're waiting for a reunion ♪

23:43.130 --> 23:45.010
I went to check on the Grief Tree.

23:45.220 --> 23:46.990
I didn't want to wake you.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.840
Send a letter if you need me.

23:49.820 --> 23:52.080
I only removed the red thread after dawn.

24:25.550 --> 24:26.450
Grandpa?

24:40.110 --> 24:40.830
Zui?

24:51.070 --> 24:51.720
Zui!

24:52.640 --> 24:53.430
Zui!

25:02.600 --> 25:03.460
Zui!

25:04.070 --> 25:04.680
Zui!

25:06.280 --> 25:07.040
Zui.

25:12.400 --> 25:14.070
Yitan.

25:28.400 --> 25:29.330
Who are you?

25:40.750 --> 25:41.590
Grandpa?

25:59.000 --> 26:00.490
During the solar eclipse,

26:00.520 --> 26:02.030
if the Black Grief Tree beyond the Boundary

26:02.030 --> 26:05.350
and the Grief Tree within exert their power simultaneously,

26:05.350 --> 26:07.690
the two giant trees will connect.

26:08.090 --> 26:12.000
Then I'll absorb the power of the Grief Trees,

26:12.360 --> 26:15.800
and breaking the Boundary will be possible.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.920
Black Fox's demonic aura.

26:25.510 --> 26:27.770
I offer my flesh and blood as a sacrifice,

26:27.790 --> 26:29.940
summoning the world's evil thoughts

26:29.970 --> 26:32.130
to destroy all light!

26:32.160 --> 26:32.960
Grandpa!

26:37.710 --> 26:39.100
I heard from Hongye that

26:39.240 --> 26:41.060
the person who released Jiuhuo in the dungeon

26:41.060 --> 26:42.450
used this technique.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.550
Yitan,

26:44.220 --> 26:47.550
submit to the darkness with me.

26:47.580 --> 26:49.890
Lady Black Fox will give us everything

26:49.910 --> 26:52.590
and share the world with us.

26:52.880 --> 26:54.560
Kill Wangquan Zui.

26:54.920 --> 26:57.270
Don't be a slave to the Wangquans anymore!

27:03.020 --> 27:04.810
I offer my faith as a sacrifice,

27:05.040 --> 27:06.650
summoning the world's light

27:07.030 --> 27:08.730
to destroy all darkness!

27:33.680 --> 27:34.720
Why are you...

27:35.270 --> 27:36.640
doing this?

27:36.680 --> 27:38.980
It's all for your own good.

27:39.590 --> 27:42.050
When have you ever done anything for my good?

27:42.110 --> 27:43.550
You're greedy and vain.

27:44.110 --> 27:46.770
Was squandering our family fortune for my good?

27:47.440 --> 27:49.100
You put me in danger.

27:50.110 --> 27:53.170
Was forcing me to activate my Clairvoyance for my good?

27:53.920 --> 27:55.520
Was driving my uncle to death

27:55.720 --> 27:58.710
and driving my aunt away for my good?

28:00.000 --> 28:01.210
And now,

28:01.290 --> 28:03.730
you want to kill the one I love.

28:04.640 --> 28:06.960
Is this all for my own good?

28:07.270 --> 28:09.060
The Clairvoyant Yangs

28:09.440 --> 28:12.870
should never have been under the control of the Wangquans.

28:13.680 --> 28:15.120
They killed your father,

28:15.200 --> 28:16.680
drove your aunt away,

28:16.750 --> 28:18.960
and now they want you to be their lackey!

28:19.070 --> 28:20.880
That's still better than

28:22.070 --> 28:25.210
living in this messed-up Yang family

28:25.400 --> 28:30.390
and looking at your ugly, vicious faces!

28:30.790 --> 28:35.050
So there is hatred in your heart after all.

28:35.160 --> 28:36.770
But this hatred

28:37.270 --> 28:39.200
is far from enough.

28:41.310 --> 28:43.810
Why don't you kill me now?

28:44.030 --> 28:45.730
If you can't kill me,

28:46.030 --> 28:49.310
I won't spare Wangquan Zui!

29:04.790 --> 29:05.790
Zui.

29:06.750 --> 29:08.960
You're a Yang daughter-in-law.

29:09.640 --> 29:13.510
Today, please help our Yitan.

30:04.000 --> 30:04.830
Yitan.

30:05.510 --> 30:07.310
This is the power of hatred.

30:08.440 --> 30:10.030
What use is love?

30:10.440 --> 30:12.720
Love will only be a handicap.

30:13.920 --> 30:15.000
Only hatred

30:15.440 --> 30:17.920
will give you endless power.

30:33.330 --> 30:34.530
Yang Yitan.

30:35.510 --> 30:38.750
Kill him to save your Wangquan Zui.

30:39.560 --> 30:41.300
Kill him,

30:41.500 --> 30:44.630
and you'll be the strongest being in the Yiqi Alliance.

31:07.930 --> 31:09.280
Yang Yitan.

31:10.200 --> 31:13.440
You've finally become what you were meant to be.

31:15.510 --> 31:16.440
Yitan.

31:17.960 --> 31:20.190
Today, I sacrifice myself

31:20.440 --> 31:23.240
to awaken your limitless power.

31:23.720 --> 31:25.110
There will come a day

31:27.510 --> 31:29.720
where those who looked down on us Yangs

31:31.510 --> 31:33.030
are trampled

31:34.790 --> 31:37.200
under the Yangs' feet!

31:54.680 --> 31:55.550
Grandpa.

31:57.550 --> 31:58.310
Zui.

32:31.740 --> 32:33.360
Lord Jiuhuo.

32:34.080 --> 32:35.700
I'm here.

33:21.400 --> 33:23.220
Even if I die today,

33:23.310 --> 33:26.140
I must take this step for Jia Lan.

33:45.000 --> 33:45.790
Yitan.

33:46.510 --> 33:47.580
Yitan!

33:51.770 --> 33:52.740
Yitan!

33:56.880 --> 33:57.720
Zui.

33:58.750 --> 33:59.400
Zui!

34:07.720 --> 34:08.550
The sky...

34:14.310 --> 34:15.469
The Grief Tree!

34:26.090 --> 34:29.159
[Libation]

34:45.139 --> 34:48.210
[Memorial Tablet of Grandfather, Yang Huanzhou]

34:53.969 --> 34:58.400
[Libation]

34:54.469 --> 34:55.370
Young Master.

34:55.650 --> 34:58.790
Everyone who came to pay their respects have been sent away.

34:58.790 --> 35:00.550
Young Master Wangquan is staying overnight

35:00.550 --> 35:02.350
to take care of Miss Wangquan.

35:04.940 --> 35:06.250
How is Zui?

35:06.710 --> 35:07.780
She's fine.

35:07.880 --> 35:11.000
They say she can return to Wangquan Manor tomorrow.

35:18.000 --> 35:18.710
You may go.

35:18.840 --> 35:19.370
Yes, sir.

35:19.420 --> 35:27.750
[Libation]

35:45.630 --> 35:46.440
Hongye.

35:47.190 --> 35:47.980
Yitan.

35:51.550 --> 35:52.410
I'm bidding him

35:53.440 --> 35:54.840
a final farewell.

35:57.830 --> 36:00.840
[Memorial Tablet of Grandfather, Yang Huanzhou]

36:37.230 --> 36:42.090
[Memorial Tablet of Grandfather, Yang Huanzhou]

36:50.510 --> 36:51.150
Yitan.

36:52.480 --> 36:55.730
I can now do what needs to be done without hesitation.

36:58.890 --> 36:59.950
I want to thank you.

37:07.240 --> 37:08.190
As you know,

37:09.200 --> 37:11.460
other families started seeking revenge

37:11.880 --> 37:13.810
since my father's disappearance.

37:14.770 --> 37:18.120
My sister and I have been on the edge the whole time.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.920
Following me,

37:21.360 --> 37:23.090
she endured endless hardship.

37:24.430 --> 37:26.220
She is my only concern.

37:29.040 --> 37:30.040
For my sister,

37:30.360 --> 37:31.680
I can do anything.

37:36.690 --> 37:37.920
However,

37:39.080 --> 37:40.420
everything changed

37:41.630 --> 37:42.690
after meeting you.

37:43.730 --> 37:46.100
My sister started smiling more.

37:47.710 --> 37:49.240
She also gradually stopped

37:50.590 --> 37:52.000
coming to me in tears.

37:55.590 --> 37:57.110
Since then, I knew

37:59.110 --> 38:00.390
that in this world,

38:01.960 --> 38:04.890
there was another person who loved her as much as I do.

38:09.010 --> 38:09.700
Later,

38:12.280 --> 38:13.940
you not only became my comrade

38:15.280 --> 38:16.670
but also my family.

38:17.510 --> 38:19.170
You helped me achieve my dream

38:19.920 --> 38:21.380
of forming the Mask Group,

38:22.670 --> 38:24.320
and we gained new comrades.

38:27.590 --> 38:28.550
So, Yitan...

38:32.700 --> 38:33.780
I want to thank you.

38:36.150 --> 38:36.960
Remember,

38:37.840 --> 38:39.280
no matter what happens,

38:40.730 --> 38:41.660
don't be afraid.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.590
I am your family.

38:47.800 --> 38:49.330
I'll always be here for you.

39:01.440 --> 39:02.320
Zui is here.

39:04.990 --> 39:06.190
Don't make her worry.

39:14.150 --> 39:14.960
It's chilly.

39:15.670 --> 39:16.590
Go back early.

39:30.150 --> 39:30.840
Zui.

39:33.110 --> 39:33.920
I'm sorry.

40:14.880 --> 40:15.960
I don't blame you.

40:19.040 --> 40:20.630
But let's make this clear.

40:21.280 --> 40:22.760
When I get better,

40:24.590 --> 40:27.230
you owe me several jars of good wine.

40:29.810 --> 40:30.870
Drink with me then.
